WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.166
In this verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:33.666
now reveals the specific path

3
00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.625
through which He can truly be known.

4
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:39.333
In the previous verse,
He had ruled out Vedic study,

5
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.458
sacrifice, charity,

6
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:41.291
or austerity

7
00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.291
as means

8
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:45.666
to know Him.

9
00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.916
Now He states clearly

10
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:51.208
that only through ananya bhakti

11
00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:53.875
can one truly understand Him.

12
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.750
He can see Him as

13
00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.500
He really is.

14
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.083
In this verse, Lord Krishna makes clear

15
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:08.458
that devotion is the only path

16
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:11.458
through which He can truly be understood.

17
00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:14.333
He uses the words ananya bhakti.

18
00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:15.708
This means

19
00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:20.000
love dedicated to one alone, without division.

20
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.500
It is without distraction

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.625
or expectation of personal gain.

22
00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:28.083
This devotion is not merely
emotional attachment.

23
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:30.416
It is a state of complete surrender.

24
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:31.375
In it, the heart

25
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:34.583
remains wholly engaged in His service.

26
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:37.541
Knowledge, ritual, and austerity

27
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:41.083
operate at the level of mind, intellect, and body.

28
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:43.916
Devotion is the path of the heart.

29
00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:45.166
It encompasses all

30
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:48.541
aspects of a person, but

31
00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.125
it is driven not by duty,

32
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:53.041
but by love.

33
00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:55.666
Lord Krishna emphasises that

34
00:01:55.666 --> 00:02:00.291
through devotion alone
can He be drashtum – seen,

35
00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:03.541
jnatum, that is - known and pravestum,

36
00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:06.833
that is, entered into.

37
00:02:06.833 --> 00:02:10.166
The word pravestum is not
mere intellectual understanding,

38
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.250
but points to a true experience

39
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.708
of Lord Krishna's divine

40
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.666
reality.

41
00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:19.875
It is like entering a city.

42
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:20.666
By entering,

43
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:23.125
one does not become the city, but

44
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:27.000
one fully experiences its presence.

45
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.166
In the same way, through devotion, one

46
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.166
does not merge into Lord Krishna, but

47
00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.916
becomes deeply connected to Him.

48
00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:38.791
This verse also breaks the thinking

49
00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.458
that says God is formless

50
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:44.333
and that devotion is merely a lower

51
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.250
level of spiritual practice.

52
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.541
Lord Krishna even claims

53
00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:52.000
that devotion is the supreme and only means

54
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.458
of truly knowing Him.

55
00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:57.000
Those who seek liberation

56
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.541
also need devotion.

57
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:02.625
It is essential for reaching their goal.

58
00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:04.041
Thus Lord Krishna

59
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:06.875
firmly establishes that His true

60
00:03:06.875 --> 00:03:10.083
form can only be understood through devotion.

61
00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:13.708
This form is eternal and full of knowledge

62
00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:15.250
and bliss.

63
00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:21.833
Some things in life

64
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:27.375
are understood only when
you listen with the heart.

65
00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:29.541
Just as

66
00:03:29.541 --> 00:03:33.833
I can be known only through devotion,

67
00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:36.208
that love

68
00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:37.750
which comes from the heart,

69
00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.833
in the same way there are also situations

70
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:44.333
where logic alone cannot

71
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:48.625
guide you.

72
00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:51.500
When you must make a difficult decision,

73
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.875
your heart often

74
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:56.750
knows what is right

75
00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.541
before your mind

76
00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:02.000
has reasoned it out.

77
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.333
Think about relationships.

78
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:09.416
Understanding the feelings of a loved one

79
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:13.208
is not about analysing their words,

80
00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:16.250
but deeply understanding the feelings

81
00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.166
of their heart.

82
00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:20.750
Keep this in mind.

83
00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.916
When you choose a path

84
00:04:22.916 --> 00:04:28.166
in life, sometimes the most fulfilling choices

85
00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:32.708
are those that come from the heart,

86
00:04:32.708 --> 00:04:34.000
not those

87
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.916
that look best on paper.

88
00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:39.958
Ignoring your heart

89
00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:45.208
can lead to confusion and regret.

90
00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:49.708
But when you listen to the heart carefully,

91
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:53.833
you find clarity and peace.

92
00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:54.958
Learn to balance

93
00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:57.916
logic with the voice

94
00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:01.750
within.

95
00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.291
It is in your heart

96
00:05:04.291 --> 00:05:09.291
that I speak most clearly.

97
00:05:13.833 --> 00:05:17.208
In your family life,

98
00:05:17.208 --> 00:05:19.375
true understanding

99
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:21.750
matters far more

100
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:25.375
than logic and reasoning.

101
00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:27.291
Remember,

102
00:05:27.291 --> 00:05:32.500
understanding with the heart is
the most important thing in a family.

103
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.458
Just as through devotion

104
00:05:34.458 --> 00:05:38.750
I can be fully known,

105
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.958
in the same way the depths of loved ones

106
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:46.750
are understood when you
connect with the heart.

107
00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.291
When you

108
00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:51.208
experience with the heart,

109
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:53.750
patience, compassion,

110
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:59.875
and a sense of belonging blossom on their own.

111
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:01.250
But if

112
00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.250
you rely only on the mind,

113
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.750
you may miss the deeper feelings

114
00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:11.125
of those close to you.

115
00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:13.375
A child's defiance

116
00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:16.625
may not simply be rebellion.

117
00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:18.250
It may be

118
00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:22.583
that they are seeking attention.

119
00:06:22.583 --> 00:06:24.958
A spouse's silence

120
00:06:24.958 --> 00:06:27.125
may not be indifference,

121
00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:30.750
but a sign of an inner

122
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:34.208
struggle they are going through.

123
00:06:34.208 --> 00:06:38.791
When you handle these situations with empathy

124
00:06:38.791 --> 00:06:42.250
and compassion,

125
00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.791
you truly

126
00:06:43.791 --> 00:06:49.708
begin to see deeper.

127
00:06:49.708 --> 00:06:53.541
It lets you experience

128
00:06:53.541 --> 00:06:56.541
what words alone cannot express.

129
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:59.750
This is why I say

130
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.083
that listening with the heart is essential.

131
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:07.083
It is from this that patience, kindness,

132
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:11.250
and true connection grow.

133
00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.250
Remember,

134
00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.375
just as devotion

135
00:07:15.375 --> 00:07:20.416
reveals Me fully to the devotee,

136
00:07:20.416 --> 00:07:21.541
in the same way

137
00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:26.291
some truths of relationships become clear only

138
00:07:26.291 --> 00:07:31.000
when you think from your heart.

139
00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.041
Through devotion

140
00:07:33.041 --> 00:07:36.791
you come to know Me

141
00:07:36.791 --> 00:07:38.875
as I am.

142
00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:42.208
In the same way, by
understanding with the heart,

143
00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.750
you see your loved ones

144
00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:48.041
in their true form.

145
00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.125
Success at work too

146
00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:56.875
is like devotion.

147
00:07:56.875 --> 00:08:00.416
It requires focused attention

148
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:04.916
and complete dedication.

149
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:06.791
Just as

150
00:08:06.791 --> 00:08:10.875
I can be known through complete surrender,

151
00:08:10.875 --> 00:08:12.541
in the same way

152
00:08:12.541 --> 00:08:14.791
goals at work too

153
00:08:14.791 --> 00:08:18.833
are achieved through full concentration.

154
00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:20.750
Whatever you do,

155
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:25.166
do it with your whole heart and commitment.

156
00:08:25.166 --> 00:08:27.208
Only then does true success come.

157
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:30.416
Half-hearted effort

158
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:34.708
or divided attention gives average results.

159
00:08:34.708 --> 00:08:38.333
But when you work with complete dedication,

160
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:40.416
excellence in your work

161
00:08:40.416 --> 00:08:44.291
comes naturally.

162
00:08:44.291 --> 00:08:46.625
Think of the leader

163
00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:48.625
who does not inspire the team

164
00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:51.291
by multitasking,

165
00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:54.541
but by being present with them

166
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:56.375
and remaining committed,

167
00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:58.208
inspiring them.

168
00:08:58.208 --> 00:09:01.416
Or think of the project

169
00:09:01.416 --> 00:09:03.833
that succeeds because

170
00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:06.958
someone put their full
energy into it, without distraction,

171
00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:08.375
without doubt,

172
00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:12.291
with single-pointed focus.

173
00:09:12.291 --> 00:09:13.625
When your heart

174
00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:14.583
and mind

175
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:18.000
align with the work,

176
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.833
challenges become opportunities.

177
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:23.250
Just as devotion

178
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.791
leads to deep connection with Me,

179
00:09:26.791 --> 00:09:29.125
in the same way focused effort

180
00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:34.916
leads you, in your professional life,
to deep success.

181
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:37.708
So I say, whatever

182
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:42.125
you do, put your whole heart into it.

183
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:44.458
Only then does true success come.
